Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:55:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: README speed table shows plain and DFlash2 before and
 after with the machine, and a table of the Vulkan support this fork adds

Each speed row is one A/B on one file: the fork build without the kernel against the build with it, plain and
DFlash2 (two drafted tokens per step), on the Beelink SER7 Pro with the Radeon 780M. The GSQ IQ3_S row leaves
the table: its only paired receipts are ties. Under the speed table a new table names, per format family, the
upstream b10825 Vulkan state, the shader files here and what was added; eight families are new on Vulkan.
docs/arifi/STATUS.md follows the moved README rows.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documents for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
